      <h1>Quick Start Guide</h1>
      <p>Get the platform running in under 5 minutes.</p>

      <h2>Prerequisites</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Docker Desktop (v24+) with Docker Compose v2</li>
        <li>8GB+ RAM available for Docker</li>
        <li>Git</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Steps</h2>
      <h3>1. Clone the repository</h3>
      <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/rachit0412/agentic-platform.git
cd agentic-platform</code></pre>

      <h3>2. Configure environment</h3>
      <pre><code>cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your API keys (optional for local Ollama)</code></pre>

      <h3>3. Start all services</h3>
      <pre><code>docker-compose up -d</code></pre>

      <h3>4. Pull Ollama models</h3>
      <pre><code>docker exec ollama ollama pull llama3
docker exec ollama ollama pull nomic-embed-text</code></pre>

      <h3>5. Open the dashboard</h3>
      <p>Navigate to <code>http://localhost:3000</code> in your browser.</p>

      <div class="docs-callout tip">
        <strong>Tip:</strong> Use the "Run Agent" page to test your first agent interaction. The default agent works with Ollama out of the box — no API keys needed.
