      <h1>System Architecture</h1>
      <p>The platform follows a microservices architecture with clear separation of concerns.</p>

      <h2>Service Interaction</h2>
      <div class="docs-diagram">
        <div class="mermaid">
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as UI Console
    participant A as Agent Service
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant T as Tools Service
    participant KB as ChromaDB
    participant M as SQLite

    U->>UI: Submit prompt
    UI->>A: POST /agent/run (SSE)
    A->>M: Load conversation history
    A->>KB: RAG retrieval (if relevant)
    A->>LLM: Generate response
    LLM-->>A: Stream tokens
    A->>T: Execute tool calls
    T-->>A: Tool results
    A->>LLM: Continue with tool results
    LLM-->>A: Final response
    A->>M: Save to memory
    A-->>UI: SSE stream
    UI-->>U: Rendered response
        </div>
      </div>

