      <h1>Tools &amp; MCP</h1>
      <p>Agents can use tools to interact with external systems. The platform supports the Model Context Protocol (MCP).</p>

      <h2>Built-in Tools</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Web Search:</strong> Search the internet for current information</li>
        <li><strong>Calculator:</strong> Mathematical computations</li>
        <li><strong>Document Lookup:</strong> Query the knowledge base</li>
        <li><strong>Note Taking:</strong> Save and retrieve notes</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>MCP Integration</h2>
      <p>Connect external MCP-compatible tools via the <a href="/mcp" style="color:#06b6d4">MCP</a> page. The platform acts as an MCP client, allowing agents to discover and use tools from MCP servers.</p>
